  "ruleText": "Env-A 1001.02 Applicability. This part shall apply to any person conducting open burning within the state.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.1, eff 12-7-75; amd by #1036, eff 10-15-77; #1717, eff 2-19-81; amd #2092, eff 7-20-82; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #4619, eff 5-26-89; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6283-B, eff 7-10-96; ss by #7850, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9863, INTERIM, eff 3-4-11, EXPIRES: 8-31-11; ss by #9909, eff 5-1-11; ss by #12831, eff 8-1-19",
